cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin or its bundled skills, cite the project and the author below."
title: "astro-ph-researcher: astronomy terms, references, writing and data-workflow workbench for DeepSeek Harness"
abstract: >-
  A local DSH host/client plugin for astronomy: NADC-validated terminology,
  literature search and a local reference library, journal/thesis writing
  handoff, a methods/statistics library based on the book
  "天文数据处理与虚拟天文台" (2024), and an observatory/data-workflow directory.
